    "summary": "Use it in your Charge phase right after a **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** unit of yours finishes a **[Charge Move](vsdata:core-rule/charge-move)**. With that unit:\n\n1. Pick an enemy unit it engages.\n2. Pick 1 of its models that is **engaged** with the chosen enemy.\n3. Roll as many D6 as that model's Toughness. Each 1 inflicts 1 **[Mortal Wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** on your unit; each 5+ inflicts 1 on the enemy.\n\nEach of the 2 units suffers at most 6 Mortal Wounds this way.",
